sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant A as Order API
    participant DB as Transactional DB
    C->>A: POST /orders with Idempotency-Key
    A->>DB: BEGIN transaction
    A->>DB: Check or insert unique idempotency key
    alt key already committed
        DB-->>A: Previous result
        A-->>C: Original response
    else first request
        A->>DB: Conditional stock update
        alt insufficient stock
            A->>DB: ROLLBACK
            A-->>C: 409 Out of stock
        else stock available
            A->>DB: Create order and outbox event
            A->>DB: COMMIT
            A-->>C: 201 Order created
        end
    end
